1
00:01:30,566 --> 00:01:31,551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

2
00:01:31,551 --> 00:01:33,560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

3
00:01:35,260 --> 00:01:38,940
=Episode 19=

4
00:01:39,860 --> 00:01:40,420
Father!

5
00:01:41,060 --> 00:01:42,100
It hurts so much...

6
00:01:42,260 --> 00:01:42,700
Enough!

7
00:01:44,020 --> 00:01:44,540
Drop the act.

8
00:01:45,780 --> 00:01:47,340
When have you ever planned things

9
00:01:47,580 --> 00:01:48,740
so carefully before?

10
00:01:49,260 --> 00:01:50,220
Did someone put you up to this?

11
00:01:54,860 --> 00:01:56,620
(Father rarely praises me.)

12
00:01:57,820 --> 00:01:58,180
Father,

13
00:01:59,540 --> 00:02:00,780
I'm a grown man now.

14
00:02:01,700 --> 00:02:02,660
I can handle

15
00:02:03,100 --> 00:02:04,140
a little thing like this.

16
00:02:09,340 --> 00:02:09,740
Well...

17
00:02:10,620 --> 00:02:12,060
You're nothing but trouble for me.

18
00:02:13,980 --> 00:02:14,780
You scared me to death.

19
00:02:16,220 --> 00:02:16,660
Ouch!

20
00:02:19,860 --> 00:02:20,260
By the way,

21
00:02:21,300 --> 00:02:24,980
that assessor, Yang Si, from the Court
of Judicial Review...

22
00:02:25,740 --> 00:02:27,420
Did you know him before?

23
00:02:28,540 --> 00:02:30,180
Why would I know him?

24
00:02:30,540 --> 00:02:31,740
He's a nobody.

25
00:02:33,500 --> 00:02:34,420
Listen to that arrogance.

26
00:02:35,500 --> 00:02:37,380
Actually, seeing you act like a fool

27
00:02:38,060 --> 00:02:38,740
puts my mind at ease.

28
00:02:41,900 --> 00:02:42,620
Focus on recovering.

29
00:02:42,860 --> 00:02:43,940
And stop running around.

30
00:02:44,580 --> 00:02:46,780
You really gave me a scare this time.

31
00:02:48,700 --> 00:02:49,140
Tomorrow...

32
00:02:49,460 --> 00:02:51,180
Tomorrow, I'll assign you

33
00:02:52,020 --> 00:02:53,380
some of my finest personal guards.

34
00:02:54,260 --> 00:02:55,980
They'll keep you safe
whenever you go out.

35
00:02:57,380 --> 00:02:58,620
Thank you, Father! Thank you!

36
00:02:58,980 --> 00:02:59,460
Shut up.

37
00:03:24,460 --> 00:03:24,860
Your Highness.

38
00:03:25,980 --> 00:03:26,940
How's Liu Wenji?

39
00:03:28,140 --> 00:03:28,860
He just fell asleep.

40
00:03:29,700 --> 00:03:30,260
Lately,

41
00:03:31,420 --> 00:03:32,860
he's finally been sleeping
a little better.

42
00:03:34,940 --> 00:03:35,940
He was having nightmares every night.

43
00:03:36,580 --> 00:03:37,460
It was heartbreaking to hear.

44
00:03:39,620 --> 00:03:40,420
Back then,

45
00:03:41,540 --> 00:03:42,940
Chunhua would cry herself to sleep

46
00:03:43,380 --> 00:03:44,260
and wake up crying.

47
00:03:47,620 --> 00:03:49,020
Zhang Jun brought this upon himself.

48
00:03:49,700 --> 00:03:50,780
He got exactly what he deserved.

49
00:03:54,820 --> 00:03:56,540
Both men rely on powerful backers.

50
00:03:57,260 --> 00:04:00,580
It all comes down to whose backer
is more ruthless.

51
00:04:01,580 --> 00:04:04,020
If Zhang Jun had even
a shred of decency,

52
00:04:04,900 --> 00:04:06,220
he wouldn't try to silence Yu Xianyao

53
00:04:07,180 --> 00:04:08,780
and provoke the man backing him.

54
00:04:14,100 --> 00:04:14,820
But Yan Shang,

55
00:04:15,900 --> 00:04:16,740
how could you be so sure

56
00:04:16,940 --> 00:04:18,500
that every move

57
00:04:18,780 --> 00:04:20,060
would fall into place as you want?

58
00:04:22,780 --> 00:04:23,580
You give me too much credit,
Your Highness.

59
00:04:23,980 --> 00:04:24,820
I'm no prophet.

60
00:04:25,100 --> 00:04:26,100
How could I predict everything?

61
00:04:26,820 --> 00:04:28,460
I was just trying my luck.

62
00:04:29,180 --> 00:04:29,820
If it didn't work this time,

63
00:04:29,940 --> 00:04:30,620
I'd try again.

64
00:04:31,220 --> 00:04:31,940
And if that failed,

65
00:04:32,540 --> 00:04:33,660
I'd keep trying until I succeeded.

66
00:04:34,980 --> 00:04:36,180
As long as Zhang Jun was alive,

67
00:04:36,820 --> 00:04:38,980
I'd make him pay for what he did.

68
00:04:41,500 --> 00:04:42,860
What a ruthless collator.

69
00:04:57,740 --> 00:04:58,420
(Slowly. Take it easy.)

70
00:04:59,340 --> 00:05:00,260
(Be extra careful these days.)

71
00:05:00,260 --> 00:05:02,300
(Sumai Shop)

72
00:05:02,700 --> 00:05:03,100
Wenji.

73
00:05:04,220 --> 00:05:04,580
Look.

74
00:05:11,900 --> 00:05:13,820
That's Zhang Cheng,
the Minister of Revenue.

75
00:05:19,060 --> 00:05:20,900
He was dismissed from office
a few days ago.

76
00:05:21,820 --> 00:05:23,300
(Sumai Shop)
Now he's heading home with a coffin.

77
00:05:23,820 --> 00:05:24,380
So...

78
00:05:27,220 --> 00:05:28,620
Even an arrogant, spoiled brat like him

79
00:05:30,900 --> 00:05:32,660
is helpless against someone
more powerful.

80
00:05:34,820 --> 00:05:36,780
Just like livestock,

81
00:05:37,700 --> 00:05:39,300
he's at their mercy.

82
00:05:44,820 --> 00:05:46,380
So this is how Sheng'an works?

83
00:06:06,700 --> 00:06:07,100
Shang.

84
00:06:10,500 --> 00:06:11,740
I want to see the Princess.

85
00:06:26,420 --> 00:06:27,180
Don't thank me.

86
00:06:28,100 --> 00:06:28,780
I only helped you

87
00:06:29,140 --> 00:06:30,380
because of Chunhua.

88
00:06:45,580 --> 00:06:46,300
Your Highness, I can never

89
00:06:47,180 --> 00:06:48,420
repay what you've done for me.

90
00:06:49,340 --> 00:06:49,900
But...

91
00:06:52,140 --> 00:06:53,940
I have one more favor to ask.

92
00:06:55,260 --> 00:06:55,980
Go on.

93
00:06:56,980 --> 00:06:57,580
I'll see what I can do.

94
00:06:59,460 --> 00:07:00,380
I'm not asking

95
00:07:00,940 --> 00:07:02,060
for money or jewels.

96
00:07:03,100 --> 00:07:04,780
I beg you to send me to the palace

97
00:07:05,620 --> 00:07:06,900
to serve as a palace eunuch.

98
00:07:09,180 --> 00:07:09,540
Wenji!

99
00:07:10,260 --> 00:07:10,980
Have you lost your mind?

100
00:07:14,900 --> 00:07:15,740
You want to enter the palace?

101
00:07:20,220 --> 00:07:21,180
That palace

102
00:07:21,620 --> 00:07:23,220
will swallow you alive.

103
00:07:23,820 --> 00:07:26,100
Even royals die there.
Countless of them.

104
00:07:26,940 --> 00:07:27,820
Palace maids and eunuchs?

105
00:07:28,580 --> 00:07:30,140
They're treated like dirt.

106
00:07:35,060 --> 00:07:36,540
Just look at what happened to Chunhua.

107
00:07:36,660 --> 00:07:37,060
I know.

108
00:07:40,460 --> 00:07:41,740
Chunhua and I...

109
00:07:43,500 --> 00:07:44,980
In the palace or out,

110
00:07:46,860 --> 00:07:48,020
we're both disposable.

111
00:07:50,260 --> 00:07:50,860
After all this,

112
00:07:51,500 --> 00:07:52,300
with both your help,

113
00:07:52,300 --> 00:07:53,500
I've finally figured it out.

114
00:07:55,660 --> 00:07:56,460
Zhang Jun wasn't the only one

115
00:07:57,220 --> 00:07:58,140
who destroyed my life.

116
00:07:59,340 --> 00:08:00,300
And what happened to Chunhua

117
00:08:00,860 --> 00:08:02,980
wasn't just the Prince of Jin
and Lord Yu's doing.

118
00:08:04,540 --> 00:08:06,860
In Sheng'an, power chews people up
and spits them out.

119
00:08:12,140 --> 00:08:12,460
Shang,

120
00:08:13,860 --> 00:08:14,580
even you

121
00:08:15,580 --> 00:08:16,900
have far more power than I do.

122
00:08:18,940 --> 00:08:20,100
You can help me get revenge

123
00:08:21,620 --> 00:08:22,740
and decide what happens to me.

124
00:08:26,740 --> 00:08:28,060
And Chunhua marrying
the Prince of Jin...

125
00:08:33,100 --> 00:08:34,860
You decided her fate too,
didn't you, Your Highness?

126
00:08:51,100 --> 00:08:51,420
Shang,

127
00:08:53,420 --> 00:08:54,740
I can't live like this anymore.

128
00:08:55,660 --> 00:08:57,300
Powerless, at everyone else's mercy.

129
00:09:00,620 --> 00:09:01,220
But...

130
00:09:05,060 --> 00:09:05,500
Yan Shang,

131
00:09:07,980 --> 00:09:09,820
you came to Sheng'an with nothing too.

132
00:09:12,500 --> 00:09:13,420
Do you really think

133
00:09:14,820 --> 00:09:16,340
I can't do what you did?

134
00:09:20,700 --> 00:09:21,220
Is that it?

135
00:09:24,420 --> 00:09:25,060
Wenji,

136
00:09:27,060 --> 00:09:28,300
I've never underestimated you.

137
00:09:32,500 --> 00:09:33,660
Well said, Liu Wenji.

138
00:09:34,820 --> 00:09:35,860
I didn't want to help you,

139
00:09:37,060 --> 00:09:37,980
but I've

140
00:09:38,380 --> 00:09:39,220
changed my mind.

141
00:09:41,580 --> 00:09:42,780
After all you've been through,

142
00:09:43,140 --> 00:09:44,100
what's left to be afraid of?

143
00:09:46,620 --> 00:09:47,940
When life knocks you into the dirt,

144
00:09:48,740 --> 00:09:50,380
no one's going to pull you out.

145
00:09:51,020 --> 00:09:51,700
You get yourself up

146
00:09:52,300 --> 00:09:52,940
and keep going.

147
00:09:54,340 --> 00:09:54,980
Liu Wenji,

148
00:09:55,860 --> 00:09:56,780
once you're in the palace,

149
00:09:57,300 --> 00:09:58,100
stay alive.

150
00:09:58,900 --> 00:10:00,140
Don't make me lose respect for you.

151
00:10:27,620 --> 00:10:28,860
I'm dying of thirst!

152
00:10:39,220 --> 00:10:40,180
How's Yu Xianyao doing?

153
00:10:40,540 --> 00:10:41,420
He's fine, of course.

154
00:10:41,900 --> 00:10:43,020
He's probably running around already.

155
00:10:43,700 --> 00:10:44,660
One little stab in the butt,

156
00:10:44,900 --> 00:10:46,180
and the whole Zhang family goes down.

157
00:10:47,340 --> 00:10:48,380
Zhang Cheng's nearly seventy.

158
00:10:48,900 --> 00:10:49,740
His hair's gone completely white.

159
00:10:51,020 --> 00:10:52,140
Now he's taking a coffin back home.

160
00:10:53,700 --> 00:10:54,380
It's just...

161
00:10:56,100 --> 00:10:57,140
The apple doesn't fall far
from the tree.

162
00:10:57,340 --> 00:10:58,340
Look at the son he raised.

163
00:10:58,860 --> 00:11:00,180
Maybe he looks pitiful next to Lord Yu,

164
00:11:01,060 --> 00:11:02,980
but how many lives has he thrown away
over the years?

165
00:11:03,500 --> 00:11:04,940
Who's going to feel sorry
for his victims?

166
00:11:10,500 --> 00:11:11,380
About what happened...

167
00:11:13,700 --> 00:11:14,380
Do you regret it?

168
00:11:15,580 --> 00:11:16,620
You mean, saving Yu Xianyao?

169
00:11:21,060 --> 00:11:21,900
I serve at the Court of Judicial Review.

170
00:11:22,820 --> 00:11:23,660
I couldn't just let him die.

171
00:11:24,740 --> 00:11:25,780
Yu Xianyao may be
an idle good-for-nothing.

172
00:11:26,220 --> 00:11:27,300
His misfortune was an act of fate.

173
00:11:27,900 --> 00:11:28,700
Saving him was my moral duty.

174
00:11:30,020 --> 00:11:31,020
Zhang Jun has committed
countless wrongs.

175
00:11:31,540 --> 00:11:32,900
This time, he crossed the wrong person.

176
00:11:33,620 --> 00:11:34,660
He brought this disaster on himself.

177
00:11:36,900 --> 00:11:38,020
Weigh each case with care,

178
00:11:38,460 --> 00:11:39,300
and follow what is just.

179
00:11:39,980 --> 00:11:40,940
Just what I'd expect from you.

180
00:11:43,180 --> 00:11:43,620
What about you?

181
00:11:45,580 --> 00:11:46,540
You dared to provoke a tiger.

182
00:11:47,460 --> 00:11:48,460
Weren't you afraid of getting caught
up in it?

183
00:11:51,100 --> 00:11:52,020
What's that got to do with me?

184
00:11:54,660 --> 00:11:56,220
Wanyao, let's not play games.

185
00:11:57,340 --> 00:11:58,820
You have no grudge against Zhang Cheng
or his son.

186
00:11:59,100 --> 00:11:59,980
Why get involved?

187
00:12:00,940 --> 00:12:02,020
I don't know what you're talking about.

188
00:12:02,740 --> 00:12:03,460
All I know is

189
00:12:04,660 --> 00:12:07,260
Yu Xianyao and Zhang Jun
both got what they deserved.

190
00:12:07,980 --> 00:12:08,420
And another thing.

191
00:12:09,180 --> 00:12:10,700
This is the second time
you've interrogated me.

192
00:12:11,980 --> 00:12:13,260
Why do you keep taking these risks?

193
00:12:13,780 --> 00:12:14,820
Then let me ask you something.

194
00:12:15,660 --> 00:12:16,980
The night before the exam results
came out,

195
00:12:17,340 --> 00:12:18,300
you went to Cuiyun Tower,

196
00:12:19,060 --> 00:12:21,300
and met military men who'd
entered the capital in disguise.

197
00:12:22,620 --> 00:12:23,780
Who were you risking your life for?

198
00:12:27,940 --> 00:12:28,780
Looks like I was right.

199
00:12:30,900 --> 00:12:32,580
Wanyao, this is a very serious matter.

200
00:12:32,580 --> 00:12:34,740
So you won't tell me the truth either.

201
00:12:35,660 --> 00:12:36,020
Am I right?

202
00:12:41,980 --> 00:12:42,380
Come on.

203
00:12:42,900 --> 00:12:43,500
I want to see the Crown Prince.

204
00:12:47,900 --> 00:12:49,460
(Chongli Hall)

205
00:12:49,460 --> 00:12:50,700
I've come here today to ask

206
00:12:51,100 --> 00:12:51,780
why you are

207
00:12:52,900 --> 00:12:54,340
meeting with frontier generals.

208
00:13:01,380 --> 00:13:02,940
You needn't worry about me, Wanyao.

209
00:13:03,660 --> 00:13:04,820
I don't know

210
00:13:05,060 --> 00:13:05,620
what they're up to in Sheng'an.

211
00:13:07,540 --> 00:13:09,260
Yang Si served in the army.

212
00:13:10,020 --> 00:13:10,780
He got along well with them

213
00:13:11,420 --> 00:13:12,900
and couldn't refuse their invitation
to meet.

214
00:13:13,700 --> 00:13:14,940
Even Yintaimen didn't find out.

215
00:13:15,660 --> 00:13:16,220
That's all there is to it.

216
00:13:16,860 --> 00:13:17,420
And there

217
00:13:18,380 --> 00:13:19,180
won't be any more meetings.

218
00:13:21,220 --> 00:13:22,860
You mean to win over military commanders

219
00:13:23,220 --> 00:13:24,500
and unite the frontier garrisons

220
00:13:25,380 --> 00:13:26,260
so that one day

221
00:13:26,820 --> 00:13:28,660
you can rival Yu Cheng'an's Shence Army.

222
00:13:32,660 --> 00:13:33,100
Am I right?

223
00:13:38,740 --> 00:13:39,140
Your Highness,

224
00:13:39,700 --> 00:13:40,820
Wanyao has always been rather outspoken.

225
00:13:48,340 --> 00:13:48,860
Wanyao.

226
00:13:51,300 --> 00:13:52,620
Why have you come here

227
00:13:53,260 --> 00:13:54,220
to tell me all this?

228
00:13:56,620 --> 00:13:58,020
If I were afraid for my life,

229
00:13:58,820 --> 00:13:59,900
I could simply pretend I knew nothing.

230
00:14:01,340 --> 00:14:02,700
If I wanted to betray you,

231
00:14:03,380 --> 00:14:04,660
I'd have told Yintaimen long ago.

232
00:14:05,540 --> 00:14:07,380
I know you've always
underestimated women.

233
00:14:08,180 --> 00:14:10,580
But women can operate in secret

234
00:14:11,100 --> 00:14:12,060
without raising suspicion.

235
00:14:17,180 --> 00:14:18,180
I'm willing to help you

236
00:14:19,060 --> 00:14:20,180
reach the frontier armies

237
00:14:20,780 --> 00:14:21,740
in different provinces,

238
00:14:22,100 --> 00:14:22,980
even meet them secretly in disguise.

239
00:14:23,980 --> 00:14:25,180
After all, everyone knows

240
00:14:25,500 --> 00:14:26,820
how willful and reckless I am.

241
00:14:27,220 --> 00:14:29,060
Sending letters demanding gifts
from the provinces

242
00:14:29,540 --> 00:14:30,860
would be perfectly in character for me.

243
00:14:31,940 --> 00:14:33,220
And with my scandalous reputation,

244
00:14:33,740 --> 00:14:34,940
frequenting pleasure houses

245
00:14:35,340 --> 00:14:37,140
and drinking all night
wouldn't seem unusual.

246
00:14:37,540 --> 00:14:38,980
Wanyao, it's too dangerous!

247
00:14:40,020 --> 00:14:41,300
If you dare to go this far,

248
00:14:42,500 --> 00:14:43,780
why not trust me for once?

249
00:14:53,820 --> 00:14:54,500
All right.

250
00:14:58,420 --> 00:15:03,020
(Cuiyun Tower)

251
00:15:07,700 --> 00:15:12,400
♪A rough-cut gem, held close to heart;
Lean bamboo bones, yet mountain-bold♪

252
00:15:12,400 --> 00:15:17,060
♪A rough-cut gem, held close to heart;
Lean bamboo bones, yet mountain-bold♪

253
00:15:17,260 --> 00:15:21,580
♪Books bear no blade; Yet tens of
thousands of scrolls can pierce the sky♪

254
00:15:21,580 --> 00:15:26,300
♪Books bear no blade; Yet tens of
thousands of scrolls can pierce the sky♪

255
00:15:27,380 --> 00:15:31,660
♪My body is the furnace,
flames reach the clouds♪

256
00:15:31,780 --> 00:15:36,820
♪Winds gather, then drift apart♪

257
00:15:37,180 --> 00:15:39,140
♪I see no court, only a boundless world♪

258
00:15:39,140 --> 00:15:39,540
Mr. Wang.

259
00:15:39,980 --> 00:15:40,260
Over here!

260
00:15:41,740 --> 00:15:42,060
Coming!

261
00:15:44,500 --> 00:15:45,700
Someone close the window, please!

262
00:15:46,500 --> 00:15:51,100
♪I gaze at high peaks
and sails far away♪

263
00:15:51,460 --> 00:15:55,540
♪With the world in my heart,
I leave the shore♪

264
00:15:55,700 --> 00:16:00,300
♪With rain ahead, I cross the pass♪

265
00:16:01,060 --> 00:16:05,140
♪Who'll wait with me for the boat home?♪

266
00:16:05,700 --> 00:16:10,460
♪By noon, the mist will lift;
rivers will bend♪

267
00:16:10,780 --> 00:16:14,420
♪I'll take the open road
and journey home♪

268
00:16:15,140 --> 00:16:19,940
♪With rosy clouds,
I bid the moon goodnight♪

269
00:16:20,620 --> 00:16:24,260
♪And trade my old robes for new♪

270
00:16:33,420 --> 00:16:34,540
Let's go. He'll only get on your nerves.

271
00:17:37,860 --> 00:17:41,860
♪The midsummer breeze
blows soft and sweet♪

272
00:17:41,860 --> 00:17:46,300
♪Fireflies dance freely
through the night♪

273
00:17:46,420 --> 00:17:50,440
♪Chasing the beauty
of this fleeting world♪

274
00:17:50,440 --> 00:17:54,620
♪A thousand lights turn night into day♪

275
00:17:54,700 --> 00:17:58,860
♪Cicada songs mingle with the wine♪

276
00:17:58,860 --> 00:18:03,140
♪Their songs linger
through the passing years♪

277
00:18:03,420 --> 00:18:07,080
♪Life is but a fleeting stay; How lucky
I am to walk this path with you♪

278
00:18:07,080 --> 00:18:11,220
♪Life is but a fleeting stay; How lucky
I am to walk this path with you♪

279
00:18:12,020 --> 00:18:15,860
♪Playing out life's game,
forever by your side♪

280
00:18:15,860 --> 00:18:20,180
♪Innocent years drift gently by♪

281
00:18:20,580 --> 00:18:24,040
♪I thought time might stand still;
Forever at that crossroads♪

282
00:18:24,040 --> 00:18:28,020
♪I thought time might stand still;
Forever at that crossroads♪

283
00:18:29,140 --> 00:18:33,060
♪Watching flowers bloom and fade;
Weathering life's rise and fall♪

284
00:18:33,060 --> 00:18:36,900
♪Watching flowers bloom and fade;
Weathering life's rise and fall♪

285
00:18:37,540 --> 00:18:41,500
♪Turns out, unspoken tenderness;
Is starlight caught in your eyes♪

286
00:18:41,500 --> 00:18:45,660
♪Turns out, unspoken tenderness;
Is starlight caught in your eyes♪

287
00:19:03,940 --> 00:19:05,340
That's what you get for sneaking food!

288
00:19:06,020 --> 00:19:06,940
Have you no shame?

289
00:19:07,180 --> 00:19:09,100
You're a disgrace to us palace eunuchs!

290
00:19:10,660 --> 00:19:11,420
What are you looking at?

291
00:19:13,580 --> 00:19:14,980
What are you waiting for?

292
00:19:15,460 --> 00:19:16,060
Get back to work!

293
00:19:18,340 --> 00:19:19,340
What have I always taught you?

294
00:19:19,780 --> 00:19:20,780
Are you trying to make me angry?

295
00:19:22,220 --> 00:19:22,740
Hurry up!

296
00:19:23,180 --> 00:19:23,460
Scrub!

297
00:19:23,780 --> 00:19:24,140
Keep scrubbing!

298
00:19:25,900 --> 00:19:26,740
I'll deal with you when we get back!

299
00:19:28,980 --> 00:19:30,260
Sneaking food, of all things!

300
00:19:52,580 --> 00:19:52,980
Sir.

301
00:19:54,700 --> 00:19:55,660
Greetings, sir.

302
00:19:56,460 --> 00:19:57,980
We're short-handed at Hongwen Hall.

303
00:19:58,820 --> 00:20:00,180
Could you spare two men for a few days?

304
00:20:01,540 --> 00:20:04,300
You're asking me to lend you some men?

305
00:20:04,540 --> 00:20:04,900
Yes.

306
00:20:05,740 --> 00:20:06,820
We're swamped with paperwork
for the holidays.

307
00:20:07,060 --> 00:20:08,780
Even working from dawn till dark,
we can't finish copying it all.

308
00:20:09,420 --> 00:20:10,700
You have so many eunuchs
at the Imperial Cuisine Service.

309
00:20:11,380 --> 00:20:12,140
All they do is deliver meals.

310
00:20:12,420 --> 00:20:13,340
They've got time to spare.

311
00:20:13,860 --> 00:20:14,260
Why not

312
00:20:14,740 --> 00:20:15,420
let them give us a hand?

313
00:20:16,420 --> 00:20:18,180
Please don't tease me, sir.

314
00:20:18,820 --> 00:20:20,460
Servants like us

315
00:20:20,580 --> 00:20:22,580
can barely read a word.

316
00:20:22,700 --> 00:20:24,500
How could we possibly do that?

317
00:20:25,220 --> 00:20:26,260
Even if we could read,

318
00:20:26,740 --> 00:20:28,300
messy handwriting wouldn't do.

319
00:20:29,460 --> 00:20:30,060
Yan Shang,

320
00:20:30,420 --> 00:20:31,420
you must be joking.

321
00:20:32,140 --> 00:20:32,660
See?

322
00:20:33,260 --> 00:20:33,660
Right?

323
00:20:35,420 --> 00:20:36,660
Would any of you like to help?

324
00:20:39,820 --> 00:20:40,540
You see, sir?

325
00:20:40,780 --> 00:20:41,380
None of them...

326
00:20:41,380 --> 00:20:41,820
I...

327
00:20:48,220 --> 00:20:48,780
I'd like to help.

328
00:20:49,460 --> 00:20:50,260
Don't talk nonsense!

329
00:20:50,580 --> 00:20:51,820
He's only been here six months.

330
00:20:52,260 --> 00:20:54,500
He's still learning his duties here.

331
00:20:55,020 --> 00:20:56,820
King Wen wrote the Book of Changes
in captivity.

332
00:20:57,980 --> 00:20:59,980
Confucius wrote the Spring
and Autumn Annals in adversity.

333
00:21:02,060 --> 00:21:02,860
Can you write that down?

334
00:21:29,980 --> 00:21:32,300
(King Wen wrote the Book of Changes
in captivity.)

335
00:21:35,300 --> 00:21:35,772
(King Wen wrote the Book of Changes
in captivity.)

336
00:21:35,773 --> 00:21:36,340
(Confucius wrote the Spring
and Autumn Annals in adversity.)

337
00:21:36,340 --> 00:21:36,660
Well...

338
00:21:37,140 --> 00:21:38,700
That's actually quite impressive!

339
00:21:40,580 --> 00:21:42,260
You've got real talent hiding here.

340
00:21:42,700 --> 00:21:43,420
No, no, not at all.

341
00:21:46,380 --> 00:21:46,820
Good work.

342
00:21:47,500 --> 00:21:48,140
Come help us out.

343
00:21:53,060 --> 00:21:53,740
Liu Wenji.

344
00:21:54,500 --> 00:21:55,500
You...

345
00:21:57,980 --> 00:21:59,660
You'd better do a good job.

346
00:22:02,340 --> 00:22:02,700
Thank you.

347
00:22:06,260 --> 00:22:06,780
Let's go, Yan Shang.

348
00:23:26,500 --> 00:23:26,740
Here.

349
00:23:27,300 --> 00:23:27,820
Have some water.

350
00:23:28,580 --> 00:23:30,180
You won't have a moment to spare later.

351
00:23:36,860 --> 00:23:37,140
Oh, don't!

352
00:23:38,100 --> 00:23:39,340
I'm used to doing this
at the local school.

353
00:24:06,980 --> 00:24:08,060
I spent ages thinking
about it yesterday,

354
00:24:08,060 --> 00:24:09,540
but I still couldn't figure it out.

355
00:24:10,060 --> 00:24:10,900
So today, I'm going to

356
00:24:10,900 --> 00:24:12,220
give it another thorough look.

357
00:24:12,620 --> 00:24:13,140
All right.

358
00:24:14,660 --> 00:24:15,140
Yan Shang?

359
00:24:16,980 --> 00:24:17,420
Cui Ren.

360
00:24:18,060 --> 00:24:18,540
Come take a look.

361
00:24:24,140 --> 00:24:26,460
(Liao rises west of Pingchun.
Its northern source is Mt. Dayi.)

362
00:24:26,860 --> 00:24:27,140
This...

363
00:24:28,420 --> 00:24:29,180
This is excellent.

364
00:24:29,740 --> 00:24:29,980
Here.

365
00:24:30,660 --> 00:24:31,140
Take a look.

366
00:24:31,500 --> 00:24:32,140
Beautiful calligraphy.

367
00:24:32,660 --> 00:24:33,540
Look at those powerful strokes!

368
00:24:34,980 --> 00:24:36,340
Did this young eunuch copy it?

369
00:24:37,180 --> 00:24:38,780
(Liao rises west of Pingchun.)
How many years to forge such strokes?

370
00:24:39,300 --> 00:24:40,740
There's such vigor in every character.

371
00:24:40,740 --> 00:24:41,940
Look at how the strokes flow.

372
00:24:42,500 --> 00:24:44,500
It's seamless from beginning to end!

373
00:24:45,820 --> 00:24:48,180
At last, we've got someone to help
with all this copying.

374
00:24:48,860 --> 00:24:49,500
Just look at this.

375
00:24:50,380 --> 00:24:51,620
Well, all right, everyone.

376
00:24:52,460 --> 00:24:53,260
It's getting late.

377
00:24:53,700 --> 00:24:55,300
We should get back
to collating the texts.

378
00:24:55,940 --> 00:24:56,180
Right.

379
00:25:44,900 --> 00:25:45,580
Greetings, Your Highness.

380
00:25:47,500 --> 00:25:48,140
Wei Shu?

381
00:25:50,180 --> 00:25:51,300
What brings you here?

382
00:25:51,700 --> 00:25:53,180
The Censorate has granted us seven days
off for the New Year's Day.

383
00:25:53,620 --> 00:25:54,460
I'm planning to visit my hometown.

384
00:25:55,140 --> 00:25:56,300
I came to say goodbye.

385
00:25:56,900 --> 00:25:57,300
Very good.

386
00:25:57,780 --> 00:25:58,900
At least you remembered to tell me.

387
00:26:01,060 --> 00:26:01,460
Come with me.

388
00:26:14,660 --> 00:26:17,500
(Dong'e Ejiao)

389
00:26:17,500 --> 00:26:18,140
I got these for you.

390
00:26:19,100 --> 00:26:19,580
(Dong'e Ejiao)
Take them all.

391
00:26:21,100 --> 00:26:21,500
Your Highness,

392
00:26:21,900 --> 00:26:22,300
I can't accept these!

393
00:26:24,140 --> 00:26:25,260
Returning home in glory

394
00:26:25,660 --> 00:26:26,460
has always been a cherished tradition.

395
00:26:26,980 --> 00:26:27,580
(Dong'e Ejiao)
Besides,

396
00:26:27,900 --> 00:26:28,980
you work for me now.

397
00:26:29,420 --> 00:26:31,980
You wouldn't want to embarrass me
when you go home, would you?

398
00:26:32,820 --> 00:26:33,100
But...

399
00:26:36,540 --> 00:26:38,940
(Dong'e Ejiao)

400
00:26:40,980 --> 00:26:41,580
Thank you, Your Highness.

401
00:26:43,180 --> 00:26:45,580
No wonder he's so educated. Even his
name has "Wen", as in "culture"!

402
00:26:46,020 --> 00:26:47,460
He's got a head full of knowledge.

403
00:26:48,740 --> 00:26:49,580
Jealous?

404
00:26:50,060 --> 00:26:51,180
You could ask Godfather

405
00:26:51,820 --> 00:26:53,780
to give you a better name.

406
00:26:55,060 --> 00:26:55,940
Like what?

407
00:26:57,140 --> 00:26:59,140
Adding "Hua" to mine and "Xi" to yours?

408
00:26:59,180 --> 00:27:01,340
So it's like, I'll be Chen Lianhua
and you'll be Wang Xiqing?

409
00:27:01,580 --> 00:27:02,540
Those aren't bad!

410
00:27:02,540 --> 00:27:03,700
Listen to yourself!

411
00:27:06,020 --> 00:27:06,820
At first,

412
00:27:07,380 --> 00:27:09,300
all he did was run errands
and do odd jobs.

413
00:27:09,620 --> 00:27:10,460
Everyone looked down on him.

414
00:27:11,860 --> 00:27:13,620
But then, somehow,

415
00:27:15,260 --> 00:27:16,780
everyone started treating him better.

416
00:27:16,940 --> 00:27:19,420
Well, he does have
beautiful handwriting!

417
00:27:19,740 --> 00:27:20,580
You have no idea.

418
00:27:20,580 --> 00:27:21,340
Can you believe that?

419
00:27:21,540 --> 00:27:23,020
Speak up! What happened next?

420
00:27:26,340 --> 00:27:26,900
Lord Yu!

421
00:27:28,140 --> 00:27:29,300
What happened next?

422
00:27:30,380 --> 00:27:32,020
- I wouldn't dare, my lord!
- We wouldn't dare!

423
00:27:32,180 --> 00:27:33,580
What's there to be afraid of?

424
00:27:34,540 --> 00:27:35,620
I have some time to spare today.

425
00:27:36,500 --> 00:27:36,940
Go on.

426
00:27:37,380 --> 00:27:39,460
Let's hear something
I don't already know.

427
00:27:40,140 --> 00:27:42,820
We'd never dare gossip about affairs
in your residence.

428
00:27:43,100 --> 00:27:44,900
We were talking
about the Imperial Cuisine Service.

429
00:27:45,900 --> 00:27:47,300
I don't care where it happened.

430
00:27:47,420 --> 00:27:47,820
Tell me.

431
00:27:48,780 --> 00:27:49,220
Get up and speak.

432
00:27:53,700 --> 00:27:54,220
Well, Lord Yu,

433
00:27:54,580 --> 00:27:56,860
a new eunuch joined
the Imperial Cuisine Service recently.

434
00:27:57,100 --> 00:27:58,500
- That's right.
- Not only can he read and write,

435
00:27:58,860 --> 00:28:00,420
but his calligraphy is exceptional.

436
00:28:00,860 --> 00:28:02,220
He caught the attention of Hongwen Hall.

437
00:28:02,460 --> 00:28:03,780
They took him off his usual duties

438
00:28:03,980 --> 00:28:06,220
and put him to work copying manuscripts.

439
00:28:11,540 --> 00:28:12,860
What's his name?

440
00:28:13,180 --> 00:28:13,740
My lord,

441
00:28:14,220 --> 00:28:16,580
his name is Liu Wenji.

442
00:28:16,940 --> 00:28:18,260
Yes, Liu Wenji.

443
00:28:19,660 --> 00:28:22,340
(Lunar New Year's Eve)

444
00:28:23,700 --> 00:28:24,285
(Shentu)

445
00:28:24,286 --> 00:28:27,580
May Huai prosper and its people
live in peace.

446
00:28:30,060 --> 00:28:31,060
(Yulei)
May sacred wood ward off all misfortune,

447
00:28:31,580 --> 00:28:32,660
(Shentu and Yulei)
and blessings fill our home.

448
00:28:34,340 --> 00:28:35,700
May you enjoy good health
in the new year, Father.

449
00:28:35,820 --> 00:28:36,340
(Shentu; Yulei)

450
00:28:36,340 --> 00:28:36,620
Good.

451
00:28:51,900 --> 00:28:52,780
I wonder

452
00:28:53,660 --> 00:28:55,460
how much longer this aging body of mine

453
00:28:56,580 --> 00:28:58,380
can keep protecting you all.

454
00:28:59,220 --> 00:28:59,900
Father!

455
00:29:00,140 --> 00:29:01,500
Don't talk like that on New Year's!

456
00:29:12,940 --> 00:29:13,860
When you were little,

457
00:29:14,020 --> 00:29:16,140
your hands were so soft and chubby.

458
00:29:17,060 --> 00:29:20,140
Holding one felt like holding
a little dumpling.

459
00:29:22,580 --> 00:29:24,060
Back then, my hands

460
00:29:25,980 --> 00:29:27,700
weren't so dry and wrinkled either.

461
00:29:29,300 --> 00:29:30,540
Where does

462
00:29:31,820 --> 00:29:32,620
all the time

463
00:29:33,780 --> 00:29:35,340
go?

464
00:29:42,980 --> 00:29:43,580
I remember

465
00:29:44,900 --> 00:29:46,340
one New Year's Day,

466
00:29:47,500 --> 00:29:49,980
I was hosting a banquet at Hanyuan Hall.

467
00:29:50,500 --> 00:29:51,940
You suddenly came running in.

468
00:29:52,380 --> 00:29:52,860
You were

469
00:29:54,220 --> 00:29:55,620
only about this tall.

470
00:29:56,900 --> 00:29:57,500
You were

471
00:29:58,180 --> 00:29:59,180
wobbling as you ran,

472
00:30:00,740 --> 00:30:02,180
demanding a taste of wine.

473
00:30:03,860 --> 00:30:04,300
So,

474
00:30:04,860 --> 00:30:06,940
your mother took a chopstick,

475
00:30:06,940 --> 00:30:08,420
dipped it in just a little wine,

476
00:30:08,700 --> 00:30:09,620
and let you lick it.

477
00:30:11,380 --> 00:30:12,380
You were so little.

478
00:30:12,380 --> 00:30:13,300
You wouldn't remember.

479
00:30:14,140 --> 00:30:14,940
I do remember.

480
00:30:15,260 --> 00:30:16,100
The wine burned my tongue.

481
00:30:16,940 --> 00:30:18,260
How could you remember?

482
00:30:18,260 --> 00:30:19,100
You were so young.

483
00:30:21,020 --> 00:30:21,980
I also remember

484
00:30:23,380 --> 00:30:26,060
Mother wore a green silk shawl that day.

485
00:30:26,540 --> 00:30:28,500
It had beautiful little flowers
embroidered on it.

486
00:30:29,540 --> 00:30:30,620
I remember thinking,

487
00:30:31,260 --> 00:30:32,140
"When I grow up,

488
00:30:33,020 --> 00:30:33,980
I want to dress just like her."

489
00:30:37,420 --> 00:30:37,820
Yes...

490
00:30:40,420 --> 00:30:41,620
That's exactly

491
00:30:43,740 --> 00:30:44,860
how your mother looked that day.

492
00:30:49,260 --> 00:30:51,100
I can still picture her.

493
00:30:53,780 --> 00:30:55,580
As if it were only yesterday.

494
00:31:00,380 --> 00:31:01,820
Life is but a dream,

495
00:31:02,500 --> 00:31:03,220
a fleeting stay,

496
00:31:04,700 --> 00:31:05,940
a journey through a strange land.

497
00:31:06,980 --> 00:31:07,500
Father,

498
00:31:08,340 --> 00:31:09,740
it's "Life is but a fleeting stay.

499
00:31:09,900 --> 00:31:10,900
We should enjoy it while we can.

500
00:31:12,020 --> 00:31:12,900
Why waste it on sorrow?"

501
00:31:13,660 --> 00:31:14,420
You got the verse wrong.

502
00:31:18,780 --> 00:31:19,740
I remembered it wrong.

503
00:31:29,020 --> 00:31:29,540
(Father...)

504
00:31:31,580 --> 00:31:32,260
(Wait for me.)

505
00:31:34,540 --> 00:31:35,820
(Please, hold on until then.)

506
00:32:06,500 --> 00:32:11,820
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

507
00:32:11,900 --> 00:32:18,580
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- Let grief drown in your eyes♪

508
00:32:20,060 --> 00:32:23,038
♪Soar with the wind,
burning bright as a song♪

509
00:32:23,039 --> 00:32:24,900
♪Plunge into hellfire as one♪

510
00:32:24,980 --> 00:32:28,540
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

511
00:32:28,700 --> 00:32:33,620
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

512
00:32:33,940 --> 00:32:38,620
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

513
00:32:38,740 --> 00:32:40,580
♪Not a single hour less♪

514
00:32:40,660 --> 00:32:44,420
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

515
00:32:44,420 --> 00:32:48,300
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

516
00:32:48,380 --> 00:32:51,820
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

517
00:32:52,020 --> 00:32:55,380
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

518
00:32:55,660 --> 00:33:02,500
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

519
00:33:02,740 --> 00:33:04,620
♪- May time be free of fear;
- Boats rock♪

520
00:33:04,620 --> 00:33:07,260
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn;
- May time be free of pain♪

521
00:33:07,300 --> 00:33:09,860
♪You're the only one I need♪

522
00:33:09,900 --> 00:33:13,440
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

523
00:33:13,440 --> 00:33:17,060
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

524
00:33:17,140 --> 00:33:20,500
♪- Be my one and only in this world;
- Be my one and only in this life♪

525
00:33:20,540 --> 00:33:23,980
♪My last untouched innocence♪

526
00:33:24,220 --> 00:33:27,660
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

527
00:33:27,900 --> 00:33:31,340
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

528
00:33:31,460 --> 00:33:38,380
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

529
00:33:38,540 --> 00:33:40,460
♪- May time be free of fear;
- Boats rock♪

530
00:33:40,460 --> 00:33:43,060
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn;
- May time be free of pain♪

531
00:33:43,180 --> 00:33:45,700
♪You're the only one I need♪

532
00:33:45,780 --> 00:33:49,260
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

533
00:33:49,260 --> 00:33:52,940
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

534
00:33:52,980 --> 00:33:56,380
♪- Till fireworks flood the town;
- Till the lake is still and clear♪

535
00:33:56,460 --> 00:33:59,820
♪The wind blows past us♪

536
00:34:00,140 --> 00:34:04,860
♪- If there's still...
- Some warmth left in this world♪

537
00:34:05,500 --> 00:34:09,860
♪You're the only one I need♪

538
00:34:21,860 --> 00:34:22,780
Thank you, Xiaozhou.

539
00:34:23,460 --> 00:34:23,820
Father.

540
00:34:24,380 --> 00:34:25,980
I... I'd like to hear

541
00:34:27,140 --> 00:34:28,020
Shang's letter again.

542
00:34:28,780 --> 00:34:30,540
Brother, I can recite the whole thing!

543
00:34:31,340 --> 00:34:33,460
Shang says he's doing well in Sheng'an.

544
00:34:33,580 --> 00:34:34,500
He did really well on his exams.

545
00:34:35,180 --> 00:34:36,100
He placed third.

546
00:34:36,100 --> 00:34:37,140
And he got into Hongwen Hall.

547
00:34:37,500 --> 00:34:38,860
Princess Danyang treats him well, too.

548
00:34:39,060 --> 00:34:40,180
For Shang to have come this far,

549
00:34:41,220 --> 00:34:42,900
he must have faced so many dangers.

550
00:34:44,060 --> 00:34:46,300
Father, what do you mean?

551
00:35:18,500 --> 00:35:18,940
Your Highness.

552
00:35:20,540 --> 00:35:21,100
Are you all right?

553
00:35:44,300 --> 00:35:49,220
(Wei Residence, Jingzhao)

554
00:36:10,540 --> 00:36:15,660
(Cherish Kinship and Family Harmony)

555
00:36:18,420 --> 00:36:19,260
It's freezing out here.

556
00:36:19,700 --> 00:36:21,220
Why aren't you inside resting?

557
00:36:22,460 --> 00:36:22,860
Brother.

558
00:36:25,340 --> 00:36:26,780
I was looking at the old house.

559
00:36:27,540 --> 00:36:28,340
(Cherish Kinship and Family Harmony)
Compared to when I was little,

560
00:36:29,020 --> 00:36:30,060
it hardly seems to have changed.

561
00:36:31,300 --> 00:36:31,780
Yes.

562
00:36:32,740 --> 00:36:33,740
The house hasn't changed.

563
00:36:34,540 --> 00:36:35,580
Neither has the way

564
00:36:36,300 --> 00:36:37,060
people treat each other.

565
00:36:39,060 --> 00:36:39,860
As for how people treat me,

566
00:36:40,540 --> 00:36:41,620
I've been used to it since childhood.

567
00:36:42,820 --> 00:36:44,140
I don't let it bother me anymore.

568
00:36:49,140 --> 00:36:49,380
Sit.

569
00:36:57,980 --> 00:36:58,540
Shu,

570
00:36:59,380 --> 00:37:00,460
back then,

571
00:37:01,420 --> 00:37:02,220
I actually envied you.

572
00:37:02,860 --> 00:37:03,740
What was there to envy?

573
00:37:04,340 --> 00:37:05,660
You came from a lesser branch
of the family

574
00:37:05,860 --> 00:37:06,620
and were on your own.

575
00:37:07,660 --> 00:37:09,820
You had little money, but you could
come and go as you pleased.

576
00:37:10,940 --> 00:37:12,900
You didn't have to carry the weight
of our ancestors' legacy

577
00:37:13,420 --> 00:37:14,460
or the entire family's honor,

578
00:37:15,220 --> 00:37:17,140
constantly watching your every step.

579
00:37:19,180 --> 00:37:19,820
I know

580
00:37:20,340 --> 00:37:22,540
your talents go far beyond literature.

581
00:37:23,220 --> 00:37:23,700
Divination,

582
00:37:24,140 --> 00:37:24,620
alchemy,

583
00:37:25,180 --> 00:37:26,140
astronomy, engineering...

584
00:37:26,740 --> 00:37:28,220
Those are your true passions.

585
00:37:29,060 --> 00:37:30,980
Perhaps neither Sheng'an
nor the imperial court

586
00:37:32,580 --> 00:37:33,100
is somewhere

587
00:37:34,060 --> 00:37:35,700
you're meant to stay for long.

588
00:37:40,020 --> 00:37:41,020
The world is vast,

589
00:37:41,620 --> 00:37:43,020
yet there are so many places

590
00:37:43,940 --> 00:37:45,140
I can't go, or am not free to go.

591
00:37:46,420 --> 00:37:46,940
Shu,

592
00:37:48,460 --> 00:37:49,740
you have far more freedom than I do.

593
00:37:52,540 --> 00:37:53,060
Qiao...

594
00:37:59,780 --> 00:38:02,980
(Cherish Kinship and Family Harmony)

595
00:38:02,980 --> 00:38:04,060
This place brings back memories.

596
00:38:04,660 --> 00:38:06,220
I couldn't help rambling a little.

597
00:38:08,780 --> 00:38:09,980
Don't make fun of me.

598
00:38:12,020 --> 00:38:12,540
All right.

599
00:38:13,100 --> 00:38:14,300
Go inside and get some rest.

600
00:38:19,980 --> 00:38:20,340
Qiao.

601
00:38:29,580 --> 00:38:29,980
Qiao.

602
00:38:31,620 --> 00:38:32,780
Even the greatest power

603
00:38:33,620 --> 00:38:34,660
can melt away like ice and snow

604
00:38:35,100 --> 00:38:36,300
in the blink of an eye.

605
00:38:38,300 --> 00:38:39,100
The path you've chosen

606
00:38:39,940 --> 00:38:41,100
is extremely dangerous.

607
00:38:42,380 --> 00:38:43,180
Please think it over.

608
00:38:47,700 --> 00:38:48,940
You're a learned man.

609
00:38:49,900 --> 00:38:50,860
Surely you know

610
00:38:52,460 --> 00:38:53,780
that the Lord of the West

611
00:38:54,180 --> 00:38:56,500
was once merely
a vassal of the King of Shang.

612
00:38:57,460 --> 00:38:59,300
Yet history remembers

613
00:39:00,500 --> 00:39:02,020
the overthrow of the Shang tyrant

614
00:39:05,260 --> 00:39:06,860
as an act of Heaven's justice.

615
00:39:12,060 --> 00:39:12,540
Shu.

616
00:39:14,300 --> 00:39:15,500
You have your own path.

617
00:39:16,900 --> 00:39:17,380
And I

618
00:39:18,740 --> 00:39:19,780
have mine.

619
00:39:33,820 --> 00:39:37,860
(Peace and Safety)

620
00:39:41,780 --> 00:39:45,900
(Peace and Safety)

621
00:40:06,660 --> 00:40:07,100
Your Highness,

622
00:40:08,820 --> 00:40:09,820
are we really walking home?

623
00:40:10,380 --> 00:40:11,420
Your shoes will get wet.

624
00:40:13,780 --> 00:40:15,740
You've spent too long in Lingnan.

625
00:40:16,700 --> 00:40:18,380
The snow in Sheng'an
has only just settled.

626
00:40:18,900 --> 00:40:19,700
It's not going to melt yet.

627
00:40:20,420 --> 00:40:20,700
Come on!

628
00:40:22,100 --> 00:40:23,300
That's not the way home, Wanyao.

629
00:40:23,740 --> 00:40:24,980
Who said you knew where I was going?

630
00:40:25,340 --> 00:40:25,940
Aren't we going home?

631
00:40:26,300 --> 00:40:27,020
Nope.

632
00:40:27,500 --> 00:40:28,380
I want to show you somewhere.

633
00:40:31,060 --> 00:40:34,700
(Infirmary)

634
00:40:41,620 --> 00:40:45,060
(Infirmary)

635
00:40:47,780 --> 00:40:48,660
Sis's here!

636
00:40:48,660 --> 00:40:50,980
Sis! Sis! Sis!

637
00:40:51,540 --> 00:40:52,820
Sis's here!

638
00:40:54,700 --> 00:40:56,140
Sis! Sis! Sis!

639
00:40:56,140 --> 00:40:58,420
Happy New Year's Eve! Wishing you
a wonderful new year!

640
00:40:59,620 --> 00:41:00,500
Treats! Here you are.

641
00:41:00,660 --> 00:41:01,700
I want some!

642
00:41:01,700 --> 00:41:02,780
Don't fight over them.

643
00:41:02,780 --> 00:41:03,900
Can I have one?

644
00:41:04,220 --> 00:41:04,860
Give me one!

645
00:41:04,860 --> 00:41:05,940
This one's mine!

646
00:41:06,260 --> 00:41:06,900
This one's pretty!

647
00:41:06,900 --> 00:41:08,140
- Help me hand these out.
- This one's for you!

648
00:41:08,340 --> 00:41:08,820
Thank you!

649
00:41:08,820 --> 00:41:09,500
Pick whichever you like.

650
00:41:10,100 --> 00:41:11,660
Here, take your pick.

651
00:41:13,100 --> 00:41:14,300
Stop grabbing mine!

652
00:41:14,700 --> 00:41:15,300
Okay, you want this one?

653
00:41:16,140 --> 00:41:16,500
- Here you go.
- All right.

654
00:41:16,740 --> 00:41:17,140
Careful.

655
00:41:17,980 --> 00:41:18,860
Thank you, Sis!

656
00:41:18,860 --> 00:41:19,820
Can I have another?

657
00:41:19,820 --> 00:41:20,260
Thanks!

658
00:41:20,260 --> 00:41:21,260
Don't take mine!

659
00:41:21,580 --> 00:41:22,220
- There's food here!
- Here.

660
00:41:22,220 --> 00:41:22,900
- This is for you.
- Treats.

661
00:41:23,060 --> 00:41:23,540
This one's for you.

662
00:41:23,660 --> 00:41:24,980
I want to play with that too!

663
00:41:27,140 --> 00:41:27,900
You seem to know

664
00:41:28,100 --> 00:41:28,980
exactly what to buy.

665
00:41:30,660 --> 00:41:31,260
These were

666
00:41:31,460 --> 00:41:33,060
my favorite treats and toys growing up.

667
00:41:34,220 --> 00:41:34,980
Back then,

668
00:41:35,620 --> 00:41:37,460
my parents used to buy them for me
all the time.

669
00:41:38,380 --> 00:41:39,020
Now,

670
00:41:39,820 --> 00:41:40,940
whenever I want to see them again,

671
00:41:41,340 --> 00:41:42,340
I bring some for the children.

672
00:41:43,980 --> 00:41:45,340
Ever since I returned to Sheng'an,

673
00:41:45,700 --> 00:41:46,620
I've been coming here a lot.

674
00:41:46,900 --> 00:41:48,620
Sometimes I can't tell

675
00:41:49,180 --> 00:41:50,340
whether I'm comforting them,

676
00:41:51,100 --> 00:41:53,180
or they're the ones comforting me.

677
00:42:02,420 --> 00:42:03,300
Slow down!

678
00:42:07,500 --> 00:42:08,460
You can't catch me!

679
00:42:09,780 --> 00:42:10,620
Hey, come here!

680
00:42:10,620 --> 00:42:11,660
Careful. Don't burn yourself.

681
00:42:17,420 --> 00:42:18,180
Is the porridge ready?

682
00:42:18,820 --> 00:42:19,100
Yes.

683
00:42:19,100 --> 00:42:19,900
Coming!

684
00:42:24,660 --> 00:42:25,260
You too.

685
00:42:25,940 --> 00:42:27,620
Don't come crying if you burn yourself.

686
00:42:30,060 --> 00:42:30,460
Let me do it.

687
00:42:38,500 --> 00:42:38,940
That should do it.

688
00:42:50,700 --> 00:42:51,780
Come on, time to eat!

689
00:42:52,420 --> 00:42:53,380
We've got something yummy!

690
00:42:53,380 --> 00:42:54,060
Easy, easy!

691
00:42:54,740 --> 00:42:55,540
Careful, it's hot!

692
00:42:56,020 --> 00:42:57,740
No rush. There's enough for everyone.

693
00:42:57,940 --> 00:42:59,580
Smells so good!

694
00:43:05,140 --> 00:43:05,660
Give me some!

695
00:43:06,300 --> 00:43:07,380
It's so good!

696
00:43:08,260 --> 00:43:09,060
It's delicious!

697
00:43:09,260 --> 00:43:10,020
Here, try some!

698
00:43:10,180 --> 00:43:11,740
Don't eat mine!

699
00:43:14,300 --> 00:43:15,060
That's mine!

700
00:43:18,260 --> 00:43:19,140
This one's good too!

701
00:43:20,500 --> 00:43:21,580
Why aren't you eating?

702
00:43:24,020 --> 00:43:24,620
Aren't you hungry?

703
00:43:27,500 --> 00:43:28,300
My teeth fell out.

704
00:43:30,620 --> 00:43:31,980
Oh, you're losing your baby teeth.

705
00:43:37,820 --> 00:43:39,460
That means you're growing up.

706
00:43:40,140 --> 00:43:41,220
Once your new teeth come in,

707
00:43:42,220 --> 00:43:44,780
I'll bring you even
more delicious treats.

708
00:43:45,260 --> 00:43:45,660
How's that?

709
00:43:47,300 --> 00:43:47,940
Promise.

710
00:43:48,580 --> 00:43:49,020
Sis,

711
00:43:49,540 --> 00:43:51,460
I'm going to play over there now.

712
00:43:54,100 --> 00:43:54,700
Here, take this!

713
00:43:55,180 --> 00:43:56,220
Come on, try this!

714
00:43:57,060 --> 00:43:58,100
Sis, come quick!

715
00:43:58,940 --> 00:43:59,580
Look at this!

716
00:43:59,740 --> 00:44:00,700
I want more!

717
00:44:01,260 --> 00:44:02,660
Can I have another one?

718
00:44:02,860 --> 00:44:03,620
Are there any left?

719
00:44:06,260 --> 00:44:06,780
I didn't realize

720
00:44:07,540 --> 00:44:08,700
you liked children so much.

721
00:44:13,940 --> 00:44:14,740
I don't like children.

722
00:44:16,420 --> 00:44:16,900
Your Highness,

723
00:44:17,580 --> 00:44:18,460
but just now...

724
00:44:18,540 --> 00:44:19,100
Yan Shang!

725
00:44:19,300 --> 00:44:20,180
I don't like children!

726
00:44:20,500 --> 00:44:21,260
Do I make myself clear?

727
00:44:24,380 --> 00:44:29,100
(Next Episode Preview)

728
00:44:29,100 --> 00:44:31,900
Time for the Princess of Huai
to serve me in the bridal chamber.

729
00:44:47,481 --> 00:44:50,774
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

730
00:44:53,459 --> 00:44:58,375
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

731
00:45:00,569 --> 00:45:06,414
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

732
00:45:06,914 --> 00:45:12,140
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

733
00:45:14,909 --> 00:45:19,700
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

734
00:45:20,536 --> 00:45:26,615
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

735
00:45:28,416 --> 00:45:31,566
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

736
00:45:31,566 --> 00:45:33,214
♪Burning bright as a song♪

737
00:45:33,266 --> 00:45:36,990
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

738
00:45:37,368 --> 00:45:42,034
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

739
00:45:42,653 --> 00:45:46,694
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

740
00:45:47,185 --> 00:45:49,300
♪Not a single hour less♪

741
00:45:49,340 --> 00:45:56,286
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

742
00:45:57,049 --> 00:46:00,502
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

743
00:46:00,682 --> 00:46:03,827
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

744
00:46:04,266 --> 00:46:10,903
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

745
00:46:11,300 --> 00:46:13,338
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

746
00:46:13,338 --> 00:46:15,814
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

747
00:46:15,852 --> 00:46:18,321
♪You're the only one I need♪

748
00:46:18,525 --> 00:46:25,412
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

749
00:46:25,724 --> 00:46:28,995
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

750
00:46:29,300 --> 00:46:32,473
♪My last untouched innocence♪

751
00:46:32,797 --> 00:46:36,223
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

752
00:46:36,456 --> 00:46:39,681
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

753
00:46:40,012 --> 00:46:46,808
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

754
00:46:47,177 --> 00:46:49,239
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

755
00:46:49,240 --> 00:46:51,743
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

756
00:46:51,790 --> 00:46:54,128
♪You're the only one I need♪

757
00:46:54,359 --> 00:47:01,194
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

758
00:47:01,543 --> 00:47:03,161
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

759
00:47:03,291 --> 00:47:05,087
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

760
00:47:05,444 --> 00:47:08,461
♪You're the only one I need♪

761
00:47:08,501 --> 00:47:09,828
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)
